          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Let $[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ and $[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ t\\end{aligned}]$. Given that $\\mathbf{a} \\perp \\mathbf{b}$, find the value of $t$.",
